            "detailed_description": "ibb &amp; obb is a two player cooperative game set in a puzzle filled world where gravity goes both up and down. You can only succeed by working closely together.<br><br>Find a friend for some true local co-op couch fun or match up online.<br><br>Fall up and jump down through 15 levels filled with double gravity puzzles and discover 8 hidden worlds that will test your new non-Newtonian skills to the maximum.<br><br>All levels have their own unique music, composed by Kettel, known for his warm melodic electronica.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Local and online co-op<br></li><li>Warm electronic soundtrack by Kettel<br></li><li>Steam achievements, leaderboards, multiplayer, cloud saving and trading cards<br></li><li>Secret levels that will test your skills to the max</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "ibb &amp; obb is a two player cooperative game set in a puzzle filled world where gravity goes both up and down. You can only succeed by working closely together.<br><br>Find a friend for some true local co-op couch fun or match up online.<br><br>Fall up and jump down through 15 levels filled with double gravity puzzles and discover 8 hidden worlds that will test your new non-Newtonian skills to the maximum.<br><br>All levels have their own unique music, composed by Kettel, known for his warm melodic electronica.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Local and online co-op<br></li><li>Warm electronic soundtrack by Kettel<br></li><li>Steam achievements, leaderboards, multiplayer, cloud saving and trading cards<br></li><li>Secret levels that will test your skills to the max</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "ibb &amp; obb é um jogo para dois jogadores em modo cooperativo, que se passa um mundo cheio de quebra-cabeças onde a gravidade sobe e desce. Só conseguirão ter sucesso se trabalharem juntos e de perto. Encontre um amigo para um verdadeiro divertimento cooperativo local ou encontra-o online.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês, Francês, Italiano, Alemão, Espanhol (Espanha), Dinamarquês, Holandês, Finlandês, Norueguês, Português (Brasil), Russo, Sueco, Turco, Polaco, Japonês, Chinês simplificado",
